1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:06,740
Now, anti-colonialism is nothing but anti-capitalism, because colonialism is nothing but an offshoot and aspect of capitalism.

2
00:00:07,220 --> 00:00:12,160
Therefore, if you're anti-colonial, you must be anti-capitalist, if you're logical in your thinking, of course, and your actions.

3
00:00:12,640 --> 00:00:14,460
If you're anti-capitalist, then you must be socialist.

4
00:00:16,080 --> 00:00:20,820
Capitalism cannot unite Africa. Africa has to be united by socialism.

